{"title":"毛主席语录","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1966,"month":10,"day":14}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛泽东"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界是你们的，也是我们的，但是归根结底是你们的。你们青年人朝气蓬勃，正在兴旺的时期，好象早晨八、九点钟的太阳，希望寄托在你们身上。"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}